# The commit from which the commit-message rules take effect in this repository.
#
# The gate was adopted here on 2026-07-29, after the messages behind this point
# were already written and pushed. Four of them run between seven and ten
# characters over the subject limit. Linting them reports history that predates
# the rule as though it were a finding, which is not one.
#
# This is not an allowlist and it does not grow. It names the point of
# adoption. Every commit after it is checked, and the run prints the baseline it
# used so the scope is visible rather than assumed.
#
# Advanced on 2026-10-29 to 41df696c, the squash commit of pull request 298.
# Two Dependabot squash commits, 41df696c and f7207b3c, were merged without a
# hand-written --subject and carry subjects over 72 characters. Main history is
# never rewritten, so the baseline moves past them instead.
41df696c798e11913c003d8ee4355b61d219154b
